<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 00:58:03 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>截至 2026 年 8 月 11 日的当前油价</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-08-11-2026/</link><description>当油价变化时，它会影响您的能源成本，甚至日常用品的价格。原因如下。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Price-of-Oil-August-11.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 10:20:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-08-11-2026/</guid></item><item><title>Canva 是罕见的快速增长并盈利的初创公司，但人工智能成本将其增长预测削减了三分之一</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/canva-startup-growth-ai-costs-revenue-forecast-by-third/</link><description>分析师称AI正在打破SaaS的“秘密武器”，Canva及其竞争对手Figma刚刚成为最新证明&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2178275920-e1786564646169.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 20:14:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/canva-startup-growth-ai-costs-revenue-forecast-by-third/</guid></item><item><title>埃隆·马斯克表示人工智能将使金钱消失。但加密货币亿万富翁 Michael Saylor 表示，他的错误有一个关键原因：“我们是注重地位的动物”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/elon-musk-predicts-money-becomes-irrelevant-billionaire-bitcoin-mogul-michael-saylor-disagrees-shifting-luxury-wealth-status/</link><description>亿万富翁比特币大亨迈克尔塞勒表示，技术已经使曾经为国王保留的奢侈品变得司空见惯。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Saylor-GettyImages2273112978.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 15:16:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/elon-musk-predicts-money-becomes-irrelevant-billionaire-bitcoin-mogul-michael-saylor-disagrees-shifting-luxury-wealth-status/</guid></item><item><title>捐赠 80 亿美元后，史蒂夫·鲍尔默 (Steve Ballmer) 和康妮·鲍尔默 (Connie Ballmer) 创建了三个地区慈善机构，以便与工作最亲近的人可以决定如何使用这笔钱</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/steve-and-connie-ballmer-are-splitting-their-8-billion-philanthropy-into-three-so-the-people-closest-to-the-work-can-decide-how-the-money-is-spent/</link><description>鲍尔默集团正在将其三个地区办事处转变为独立的非营利组织，首席执行官特丽·路德维格 (Terri Ludwig) 表示，她宁愿像初创公司一样运营它们，而不是分拆出来。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2166961371-e1786459263200.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 15:31:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/steve-and-connie-ballmer-are-splitting-their-8-billion-philanthropy-into-three-so-the-people-closest-to-the-work-can-decide-how-the-money-is-spent/</guid></item><item><title>近十几家公司已经每月支付高达 10 万美元的费用，以抢先体验特朗普的“真相社会”帖子</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/trump-media-truth-api-insider-trading/</link><description>Truth API 的发布引起了经济学家和法律专家对内幕交易的担忧。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2287641110-e1786557827798.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 18:26:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/trump-media-truth-api-insider-trading/</guid></item><item><title>鲍勃·艾格 (Bob Iger) 和乔什·库什纳 (Josh Kushner) 以破纪录的 125 亿美元收购洛杉矶湖人队，自马克·沃尔特 (Mark Walter) 收购以来，短短 14 个月内股价上涨了 21%</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/jerry-buss-lakers-hollywood-bob-iger-josh-kushner/</link><description>两人从马克·沃尔特 (Mark Walter) 手中收购了这支球队，后者一年多前斥资 100 亿美元收购了这支球队，而魔术师约翰逊 (Magic Johnson) 曾表示，他将拥有这支球队数十年。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2232887946-e1786552059967.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 17:13:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/jerry-buss-lakers-hollywood-bob-iger-josh-kushner/</guid></item><item><title>首席信息官和首席技术官多年来一直对人工智能赞不绝口。现在，随着成本上升，他们限制了它的使用方式</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/cios-and-ctos-spent-years-lauding-ai-now-with-costs-rising-theyre-putting-limits-on-how-its-used/</link><description>在让员工广泛使用人工智能工具后，领导者对使用设置了上限，并对员工进行了再培训，让他们了解小型且便宜的模型通常可以完成这项工作。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/CIO-Intell-Compass-Dropbox-Cigna-Group.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 16:38:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/cios-and-ctos-spent-years-lauding-ai-now-with-costs-rising-theyre-putting-limits-on-how-its-used/</guid></item><item><title>忘掉晚会吧，这些硅谷学校经营着自己的风险投资基金</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/forget-the-gala-these-silicon-valley-schools-run-their-own-venture-capital-funds/</link><description>湾区的一些精英学校已经招募了来自红杉资本、Lightspeed 和 Battery 的家长捐助者，引导少量捐赠资金投入早期初创企业。随着大规模首次公开募股重新流行，学校正在为接下来可能发生的事情做好准备。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/SFHS_StudentsinCommons_NowandForever-e1786485382417.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 07:02:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/forget-the-gala-these-silicon-valley-schools-run-their-own-venture-capital-funds/</guid></item><item><title>日本和美国刚刚花费了数十亿美元试图挽救日元。为什么它已经节节败退了？</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/us-japan-yen-intervention-unraveling-weak-yen-causes/</link><description>经济学家指出，美日干预尽管可能很重要，但并没有解决日元疲软背后的根本原因。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2288079216-e1786526534950.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 17:13:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/12/us-japan-yen-intervention-unraveling-weak-yen-causes/</guid></item><item><title>阿里安娜·赫芬顿 (Arianna Huffington) 表示，即使是雄心勃勃的首席执行官也会感到不高兴，并感觉自己被困在价值数百万美元的工作中：“这是一个陷阱”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/arianna-huffington-says-even-high-flying-ceos-are-unhappy-and-feel-stuck-in-their-multimillion-dollar-jobs-its-a-trap/</link><description>《赫芬顿邮报》的百万富翁创始人阿里安娜·赫芬顿表示，成功是一个“陷阱”——拿着高薪的首席执行官不敢离开他们不再喜欢的工作&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2272612085-e1786377040745.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 07:04:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/11/arianna-huffington-says-even-high-flying-ceos-are-unhappy-and-feel-stuck-in-their-multimillion-dollar-jobs-its-a-trap/</guid></item></channel></rss>